# Breeding Bird Survey (#24): 39 core tables, 3.86 GB. All are ignored, not only those over 100 MB, to keep 1 GB out of
# history, except BCR 15's count table, so CI's gate and corpus test see one. The script rebuilds them from raw files
# downloaded by hand (ScienceBase refuses direct downloads). Side tables and __dataset.json stay tracked.
output/ziolkowski_2026_bbs_*.csv
!output/ziolkowski_2026_bbs_*__*.csv
!output/ziolkowski_2026_bbs_bcr15_count.csv
